@TamirBaydasov Thanks for your interest, and sorry for the delay! I'm opening this up for review now.

The PR has been refreshed against main and is now independent of the online W4A8 PR (#43739). It adds online W4A4 MXFP4 MoE support through `--quantization mxfp4`, reusing the existing Ascend execution path. The updated head is `9c40660a60`; 32 isolated CPU/mock tests and lint checks passed.

I'm marking it ready for review. Current-head Ascend 950 end-to-end and accuracy validation are still pending, so hardware testing and feedback would be very welcome!

